School complaint format 23.6.25.xlsx

# Complaint exports carry personal data (complainant + principal names, phone
# numbers, addresses, GPS). They were being served publicly at
# support.armee.online/complaints.json — 3297 records, no authentication.
# They are only ever used as a stale offline fallback, so blocking them costs
# nothing at runtime. school_data.json and master_data.json stay published:
# the field app fetches school_data.json at runtime (and the service worker
# precaches it), and master_data.json no longer contains any passwords.
